<TITLE>Torque Converter</TITLE>
<LIST1 TYPE = "UNORDERED"><ITEM><PTXT>Its compact size and high transmission efficiency achieve excellent starting and acceleration performance and low fuel consumption. </PTXT></ITEM>
<ITEM><PTXT>A damper construction that allows lock-up operation from the low speed range has been adopted, absorbing engine torque fluctuations and achieving an excellent ride.</PTXT></ITEM>
<ITEM><PTXT>A compact torus shape has been adopted, making the torque converter more compact.</PTXT></ITEM></LIST1>
